    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The FREMM design, developed by Fincantieri Marine Group for the cancelled Constellation class frigate program, is a strong possibility for a future opportunity in the U.S. Navy&#39;s small surface combatant plans. This design is being considered as part of a study expected to wrap up next month, indicating a potential for overseas construction of foreign frigate designs. The recent review of foreign frigate designs and the potential for them to be built overseas as part of a study suggest a shift in the U.S. Navy&#39;s approach to small surface combatants.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
